<view class="page about-page">
  <view class="about-head surface">
    <image src="/assets/app/common/ic_juejin_logo.webp" mode="aspectFit"></image>
    <view class="about-name">稀土掘金</view>
    <view class="about-version">版本 {{version}}</view>
  </view>
  <view class="about-copy surface">帮助开发者成长的社区。当前小程序以 Android 6.7.6 的信息架构与视觉资源为基准，公共内容来自公开接口，个人创作和互动状态保存在本机。</view>
  <view class="about-list section">
    <view wx:for="{{items}}" wx:key="name" class="about-row">
      <text>{{item.name}}</text>
      <text class="muted">{{item.value}}</text>
    </view>
  </view>
</view>
